Upstream-Name: Cube 2: Sauerbraten
Source: https://sourceforge.net/projects/sauerbraten/files/sauerbraten/2020_11_29/sauerbraten_2020_12_29_linux.tar.bz2
Comment: NOT FREE. The game data of the Sauerbraten 2020_12_29 release: maps, textures, models,
 sounds and music by many authors under mixed licences, much of it Creative Commons Attribution
 Non-Commercial (-ShareAlike) or all rights reserved. Personal and LAN use only; this package
 must not be put in a public repository. The licence and readme files of each directory are
 kept next to its files in /usr/share/games/sauerbraten/packages/, and the release's own
 documentation is in /usr/share/doc/sauerbraten-data. The Cube 2 engine itself is under the zlib
 licence and is not in this package.

